
sequenceDiagram
  User -> App: Insert origin and destination
  activate App

  App -> MapService: Geocode origin and destination
  activate MapService
  MapService -> App: Coordinates
  deactivate MapService

  App -> RoutingEngine: Compute candidate paths
  activate RoutingEngine
  RoutingEngine -> App: Candidate paths
  deactivate RoutingEngine

  App -> GlobalData: Retrieve aggregated path info
  activate GlobalData
  GlobalData -> App: GlobalPathInfo
  deactivate GlobalData

  App -> RankingEngine: Compute scores and rank paths
  activate RankingEngine
  RankingEngine -> App: Ranked paths
  deactivate RankingEngine

  App -> User: Display ranked paths (map and list)
  deactivate App